cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Foldit Lite — ESMFold-backed protein folding puzzle game"
abstract: >-
  A browser-based puzzle game where mutating residues triggers live
  ESMFold structure re-prediction, scored as Cα-RMSD to a target
  backbone. A background-warmed puzzle queue (asyncio-locked refills,
  one slot per template × difficulty) hides ESMFold's 3–15 s inference
  latency from the player. A three-check validator gates every generated
  puzzle. Built to teach intuition for protein folding through interactive
  play; not a research tool. ~3,250 LOC across FastAPI backend, React +
  TypeScript frontend, and 3Dmol.js structure visualization.
